nouncement\", \"source\": {\"channel_id\": \"C_RP_ANNOUNCEMENTS\", \"message_id\": \"1789567200.700002\", \"system\": \"slack\", \"thread_id\": \"1789567200.700002\"}}, \"source_type\": \"announcement\", \"record_kind\": \"channel_announcement\", \"applicability\": {\"state\": \"CURRENT\", \"revision_state\": \"CURRENT\", \"version_mode\": \"current\"}, \"dates\": {\"source_date\": \"2026-09-16T14:00:00Z\", \"basis\": \"effective_at\", \"effective_at\": \"2026-09-16T14:00:00Z\", \"created_at\": \"2026-09-16T14:00:00.700002+00:00\", \"expired_as_of\": false}, \"scope\": {\"project_id\": \"response_preference\", \"batch_id\": \"rp_batch_14\", \"scope\": \"project\", \"batch_relation\": \"other_batch\"}, \"authority\": {\"role\": \"TEAM_LEAD\", \"actor\": \"U001\", \"actor_relation\": \"MESSAGE_AUTHOR\", \"approval_status\": \"EXPLICIT_SOURCE_MARKER\", \"provenance\": \"synthetic_slack_archive\"}, \"authorship\": {\"author_id\": \"U001\", \"verified\": true, \"basis\": \"SLACK_MESSAGE_AUTHOR\"}, \"recorded_states\": {\"status\": \"tl_approved\", \"decision_status\": \"tl_approved\", \"execution_status\": \"posted\", \"outcome_status\": \"not_observed\"}, \"excerpt\": \"[ANNOUNCEMENT posted 2026-09-16T14:00:00Z by TEAM_LEAD (rp_batch_14): not established as handling for this topic until you show it is relevant and gives a directive.]\\nPreference batch 14 calibration: choose a tie when neither answer offers a meaningful quality advantage. If choosing A or B, identify the user-facing benefit rather than saying only that it sounds nicer. Keep material factual or instruction-following defects separate. Bring both rationales for disputed pairs to the eight-pair calibration review. This message clarifies the existing criterion; it does not create a new numerical threshold.\"}], \"open_review_flags\": [], \"governing_sources\": [\"k:response-preference-faq@1.1:3db12f63\", \"k:response-preference-instructions@1.1:a71c54c7\", \"k:response-preference-instructions@1.1:3350bbc0\",